<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<model version="NetLogo 7.0.3" snapToGrid="false">
  <code><![CDATA[;%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
; Assignment 3: Forest Fire ABM
; Name: [Liying Wang][Xiaoyu Zhan][Patricia Givort Cruz Cabral][Jun Shen]
; LIU-ID: [liywa691][xiazh253][patgi434][junsh159]
; Date: 09/04 April 2026
;%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%

globals [
  initial-trees
  perc-burned
]

breed [smokers smoker]
breed [firefighters firefighter]

smokers-own [ carelessness ]
firefighters-own [ speed scan-radius ]

;%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
; Environment & World Logic
;%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%

to setup-environment
  clear-all
  ask patches [ set pcolor green ]
  set initial-trees count patches
  reset-ticks
end

to update-stats
  set perc-burned (count patches with [pcolor = red] / initial-trees) * 100
end

;%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
; Fire-spread Logic
;%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%

to spread-fire-logic
  ask patches with [pcolor = red] [
    let potential-targets neighbors with [pcolor = green]
    if any? potential-targets [
      ask one-of potential-targets [ set pcolor red ]
    ]
  ]
end

;%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
; Smoker behavior Logic
;%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%

to setup-smokers
  create-smokers num-smokers [
    setxy random-xcor random-ycor
    set shape "person"
    set color black
    set size 1.5
    set carelessness ignition-probability
    print (word "Smoker created at (" (precision xcor 1) ", " (precision ycor 1) ") carelessness=" (precision carelessness 2))
  ]
end

to smoker-walk
  ask smokers [
    rt random 60
    lt random 60
    fd 1
    if pcolor = green [
      if random-float 1 < carelessness [
        set pcolor red
        print (word "Smoker at (" (precision xcor 1) ", " (precision ycor 1) ") dropped cigarette! Patch ignited.")
      ]
    ]
  ]
end

;%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
; Firefighter Logic
;%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%

to setup-firefighters
  create-firefighters num-firefighters [
    setxy random-xcor random-ycor
    set shape "car"
    set color blue
    set size 1.8
    set speed 3
    set scan-radius 4
    print (word "Firefighter created at (" (precision xcor 1) ", " (precision ycor 1) ") scan-radius=" scan-radius)
  ]
end

to firefighter-go
  ask firefighters [
    let fire-patches patches in-radius scan-radius with [pcolor = red]
    ifelse any? fire-patches [
      let target min-one-of fire-patches [distance myself]
      face target
      fd min (list speed (distance target))

      ; Extinguish fire on current patch
      if pcolor = red [
        set pcolor green
        print (word "Firefighter at (" (precision xcor 1) ", " (precision ycor 1) ") extinguished fire!")
      ]

      ; Also extinguish all red patches within reach
      ask patches in-radius 3 with [pcolor = red] [
        set pcolor green
        print (word "  -> Nearby patch at (" pxcor ", " pycor ") also extinguished")
      ]

    ] [
      ; No fire in scan radius — move toward any fire on the whole map
      let any-fire patches with [pcolor = red]
      ifelse any? any-fire [
        face min-one-of any-fire [distance myself]
        fd speed
      ] [
        rt random 45
        lt random 45
        fd 1
      ]
    ]
  ]
end

;%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
; Main Setup & Go
;%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%

to setup
  setup-environment
  setup-smokers
  setup-firefighters
  print "=== Simulation setup complete ==="
  print (word "  Trees: " initial-trees)
  print (word "  Smokers: " num-smokers)
  print (word "  Firefighters: " num-firefighters)
  print (word "  Ignition probability: " ignition-probability)
end

to go
  smoker-walk
  spread-fire-logic
  firefighter-go
  update-stats

  if not any? patches with [pcolor = green] [
    print "=== FOREST FULLY BURNED - simulation stopped ==="
    stop
  ]

  tick
end
]]></code>
  <widgets>
    <view x="224" wrappingAllowedX="true" y="11" frameRate="30.0" minPycor="-16" height="364" showTickCounter="true" patchSize="10.91" fontSize="10" wrappingAllowedY="true" width="364" tickCounterLabel="ticks" maxPycor="16" updateMode="0" maxPxcor="16" minPxcor="-16"></view>
    <slider x="10" step="1" y="10" max="20" display="num-smokers" height="33" min="1" direction="Horizontal" default="1.0" variable="num-smokers" width="195" sizeVersion="0"></slider>
    <slider x="10" step="1" y="55" max="20" display="num-firefighters" height="33" min="1" direction="Horizontal" default="3.0" variable="num-firefighters" width="195" sizeVersion="0"></slider>
    <slider x="10" step="0.01" y="100" max="1.0" display="ignition-probability" height="33" min="0.0" direction="Horizontal" default="0.5" variable="ignition-probability" width="195" sizeVersion="0"></slider>
    <button x="10" y="150" height="33" disableUntilTicks="false" forever="false" kind="Observer" display="Setup" width="90" sizeVersion="0">setup</button>
    <button x="110" y="150" height="33" disableUntilTicks="true" forever="true" kind="Observer" display="Go" width="90" sizeVersion="0">go</button>
    <monitor x="10" precision="1" y="195" height="45" fontSize="11" display="% Burned" width="120" sizeVersion="0">perc-burned</monitor>
    <monitor x="140" precision="17" y="195" height="45" fontSize="11" display="Ticks" width="70" sizeVersion="0">ticks</monitor>
  </widgets>
  <info>## WHAT IS IT?

A Forest Fire Agent-Based Model. Smokers randomly ignite patches; Firefighters chase and extinguish fire. Find the tipping point where the forest can no longer survive.

## HOW IT WORKS

- Green patches = healthy forest, Red patches = fire
- Smokers walk randomly and ignite green patches with probability = ignition-probability
- Fire spreads to one random green neighbour per tick
- Firefighters scan their radius, move toward nearest fire, extinguish it

## HOW TO USE IT

1. Set the three sliders
2. Press Setup
3. Press Go and watch the Output panel for print statements</info>
